										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Binance Wallet is excited to launch the </span><b>Binance Alpha GRVT Deposit Campaign</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">! During the Promotion Period, deposit GRVT tokens by following the campaign rules to share exclusive token rewards. This campaign is </span><b>only eligible for GRVT community airdrop users</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> who received the official GRVT airdrop on BNB Smart Chain (BSC).</span></p>
<h2><b>1. Deposit Grvt (GRVT) and Share $20K Worth of Rewards</b></h2>
<p><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-203879" src="https://ventureburn.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2026-07-30-23.34.43.jpg" alt="GRVT Airdrop Source: Binance" width="1280" height="720" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">To participate and claim your share of the reward pool, make sure to take note of the campaign&#8217;s core schedules and reward criteria:</span></p>
