<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Promotion Period:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> 2026-07-30 13:00 (UTC) to 2026-08-01 13:00 (UTC).</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Total Reward Pool:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> 66,640 GRVT (worth approximately $20,000 USD).</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Eligible Winners:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> The first 1,666 qualifying participants.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Reward Per User:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> 40 GRVT per user.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Minimum Requirement:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Deposit and transfer </span><b>at least 300 GRVT</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> in a </span><b>single transaction</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Distribution Model:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> First-come, first-served basis.</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><div class="b-cta-wrapper"><div class="b-cta b-cta--referral"><div class="b-cta__image"><a href="/recommends/binance/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" data-wpel-link="internal"><img decoding="async" width="300" height="300" src="https://ventureburn.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/binance-logo-6219389_1280-300x300.webp" class="image-fit image-fit--center wp-post-image" alt="binance-logo-6219389_1280" /></a></div><div class="b-cta__meta"><div class="promotion"><p class="title">Binance Referral Code</p><p class="value">Get $100 USDT Sign-Up Bonus</p><p>-20% Trading Fees</p><p>Code Valid: July 2026</p></div><div class="referral-code"><input type="text" value="VB2025" class="referral-code__input" readonly><button type="button" class="referral-code__btn btn btn-primary">Copy</button></div></div><div class="b-cta__btn d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center"><a href="/recommends/binance/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="btn btn-primary" data-wpel-link="internal"><span>Claim Reward Now</span></a></div></div><!-- /.b-cta --></div></span></p>
<h2><b>2. How to Participate</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Follow these steps to complete your deposit and transfer tasks successfully:</span></p>
