<ol>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Open your Binance App and navigate to </span><b>[My Wallets]</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Select </span><b>[Binance Wallet (Keyless)]</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Tap </span><b>[Receive]</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> and deposit at least 300 GRVT from your official GRVT community airdrop receiving wallet address.</span></li>
</ol>
<h3><b>Step 2: Transfer Tokens to Binance Alpha 2.0 Account</b></h3>
<ol>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Switch to the </span><b>[Exchange]</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> tab in your Binance App.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Go to </span><b>[Asset]</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> -&gt; </span><b>[Alpha]</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> to view your </span><b>Binance Alpha 2.0 Account page</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Select </span><b>[Transfer In]</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> and transfer the eligible GRVT tokens.</span></li>
</ol>
<h2><b>3. Important Notes:</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Please carefully review these eligibility parameters and rules before initiating your transfers:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Target Audience:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> This campaign is exclusively open to users who received their official GRVT community airdrop on BSC.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Sequential Requirement:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> You must complete Step 1 </span><b>before</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> Step 2 during the active Promotion Period.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Direct Wallet Exception:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> If you received the GRVT airdrop directly in your Binance Wallet (Keyless), you may skip Step 1 and proceed directly to Step 2. Eligibility will be determined based on the completion time of Step 2.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Address Verification:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> The external on-chain address used for the deposit in Step 1 </span><b>must be the exact same address</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> that received the GRVT community airdrop. Deposits from any other wallet address will </span><b>not</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> qualify.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><b>Reward Distribution:</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> All rewards will be paid in GRVT tokens and credited directly to winning users&#8217; Binance Alpha Accounts or Binance Wallet (Keyless) before </span><b>2026-08-15 13:00 (UTC)</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">.</span></li>
</ul>
<h2><b>4. What Is GRVT?</b></h2>
<p><b>GRVT</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> (Gravity) is a hybrid decentralized exchange (HEX) designed to combine the self-custodial security of DEXs with the high performance and user experience of centralized exchanges. By utilizing zero-knowledge rollups, GRVT offers high-throughput trading, privacy protection, and a seamless onboarding experience for Web3 traders.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">As part of the </span><b>Binance Wallet Alpha</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> ecosystem, bringing GRVT into the deposit campaign allows early community members and airdrop recipients to effortlessly transfer their assets onto Binance Alpha 2.0.</span></p>
<h2><b>5. Tokenomics &amp; Official Project Links</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Before trading or holding assets, it is important to review project tokenomics and rely on official documentation.</span></p>
