</ul>
<h2><b>6. Final Thoughts</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The </span><b>Binance Wallet Alpha GRVT Deposit Campaign</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> gives GRVT community airdrop holders a great opportunity to unlock an additional 40 GRVT reward. Because the promotion operates strictly on a </span><b>first-come, first-served</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> basis for the first 1,666 users, acting quickly during the promotion window is key!</span></p>
