					<description><![CDATA[<p>InvestiFi Raises Funding To Expand Digital Investing Platform InvestiFi has raised $20 million to accelerate the growth of its embedded digital investing platform for American credit unions and community banks.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://ventureburn.com/investifi-raises-20-million/" data-wpel-link="internal">InvestiFi Raises $20 Million To Expand Digital Investing For Credit Unions</a> appeared first on <a href="https://ventureburn.com" data-wpel-link="internal">Ventureburn</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2><b>InvestiFi Raises Funding To Expand Digital Investing Platform</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">InvestiFi has raised $20 million to accelerate the growth of its embedded digital investing platform for American credit unions and community banks. It represents the largest investment made into a fintech company dedicated exclusively to providing digital investing capabilities for credit unions and community banks. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">The investment round was led by Vibe Credit Union, with participation from BankTech Ventures, Idaho Central Credit Union (ICCU), Navari, United Financial Credit Union, Coastal Credit Union, Mid Minnesota Credit Union, Truity Credit Union, and Southpoint Credit Union.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">InvestiFi plans to use the capital to expand its platform, accelerate product development, and increase adoption among financial institutions seeking to retain customer deposits within their own digital banking ecosystems.</span></p>
<h2><b>Platform Helps Community Banks Retain Customers</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">Founded by CEO Kian Sarreshteh, InvestiFi operates as a Credit Union Service Organization (CUSO) that enables financial institutions to integrate investing services directly into their online banking platforms. Instead of transferring funds to external brokerages or investment apps, customers can invest directly from their checking or savings accounts.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">The company&#8217;s patent-pending &#8220;Investing from Checking&#8221; technology simplifies the investment process while helping financial institutions maintain stronger customer relationships. The platform currently supports fractional stock and ETF investing, guided investing, IRAs, cryptocurrency trading, and stablecoins, with additional investment products planned for future releases.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">According to Cornerstone Advisors research, nearly half of Gen Z and Millennial consumers actively invest, while 43% have transferred money to third-party investment platforms. InvestiFi believes embedded investing gives community banks and </span><a href="https://www.investopedia.com/terms/c/creditunion.asp" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener external noreferrer" data-wpel-link="external"><span style="font-weight: 400">credit unions</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400"> an opportunity to compete more effectively with larger financial institutions, fintech companies, and digital brokerages.</span></p>
<h2><b>Rapid Growth Demonstrates Market Demand<br />
</b></h2>
<div id="attachment_203840" style="width: 1322px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img decoding="async" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-203840" class="size-full wp-image-203840" src="https://ventureburn.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/remove_1n-Qiqv5WXi819o2a8Mg6A_egp7ji4ETY2zt_AUbPujTg_cover.png" alt="A neon futuristic visual showing digital banking platforms with integrated investing and connected financial institutions." width="1312" height="736" /><p id="caption-attachment-203840" class="wp-caption-text">InvestiFi drives growth by enabling embedded investing across community banks and credit unions. Source: Created by Ventureburn</p></div>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">InvestiFi has experienced significant customer growth over the past two years. The company expanded from just four clients in 2024 to more than 60 signed financial institutions by July 2026, reflecting increasing demand for integrated digital investing services.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">Sarreshteh said the latest funding validates both the platform and the company&#8217;s long-term mission. He noted that many of the investors are also existing customers, demonstrating confidence in InvestiFi&#8217;s technology and its ability to help community financial institutions compete in an increasingly digital financial landscape.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">Vibe Credit Union said the investment aligns with its goal of supporting members throughout every stage of their financial journey. The organisation believes digital wealth-building services have become an essential extension of traditional banking products.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">BankTech Ventures also highlighted InvestiFi&#8217;s rapid customer growth and growing market opportunity, stating that the company is addressing an important challenge faced by community financial institutions as digital investing becomes an expected consumer feature.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">More News: </span><a href="https://ventureburn.com/encore-ai-raises-30m-series-a-enterprise-ai/" data-wpel-link="internal"><span style="font-weight: 400">Encore AI Raises $30M to Expand Revenue-Focused Enterprise AI Platform</span></a></p>
<h2><b>Expansion Plans Focus On Product Innovation</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">The new capital will support platform expansion, product innovation, and wider deployment across the United States. InvestiFi aims to increase adoption among existing financial institution partners while attracting additional banks and credit unions seeking embedded investment capabilities.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">As digital investing continues to become a standard feature across financial services, InvestiFi is positioning itself as a technology partner that allows smaller financial institutions to offer investment services without requiring customers to leave their trusted banking platforms.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">To stay updated on crypto venture capital funding and market trends, visit our </span><a href="https://ventureburn.com/category/news/venture-capital/" data-wpel-link="internal"><span style="font-weight: 400">venture capital news section</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400"> for more insights.</span></p>
