					<description><![CDATA[<p>Encore AI Raises Funding To Expand Enterprise Growth Encore AI has raised $30M of Series A funding to help scale its enterprise AI platform globally. Team8 led the round along</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://ventureburn.com/encore-ai-raises-30m-series-a-enterprise-ai/" data-wpel-link="internal">Encore AI Raises $30M to Expand Revenue-Focused Enterprise AI Platform</a> appeared first on <a href="https://ventureburn.com" data-wpel-link="internal">Ventureburn</a>.</p>
