										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2><b>Encore AI Raises Funding To Expand Enterprise Growth</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">Encore AI has raised $30M of Series A funding to help scale its enterprise AI platform globally. Team8 led the round along with Planven and The Garage and was also joined by Lukatz along with a set of commercial banks and insurance companies who had already used the platform before investing in the company.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">The funding will enable Encore AI to develop its products and scale its operations globally, by increasing deployments across large enterprises and also by further expansion into financial services and other highly regulated industries with high importance placed on customer engagement and compliance.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">Encore AI was founded in 2022 by Dr. Dvir Ginzburg to solve the revenue generation challenge rather than operating cost reduction challenge as other customer service AI does, which reduces the amount of human interaction. It achieves this by teaching intelligent agents to mimic your top-performing sales and customer service people.</span></p>
<h2><b>AI Learns From Top Performers To Increase Revenue<br />
</b></h2>
<div id="attachment_203836" style="width: 1322px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img decoding="async" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-203836" class="size-full wp-image-203836" src="https://ventureburn.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/remove_cgjTjUCJWai8DfrK1mIrjw_0UrMjSQDSiKCs-dEMZaIsw_cover.png" alt="A neon futuristic visual showing AI agents analysing customer interactions and generating real-time business insights." width="1312" height="736" /><p id="caption-attachment-203836" class="wp-caption-text">Encore AI transforms customer interaction data into revenue-driving AI agents for enterprise growth. Source: Created by Ventureburn</p></div>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">At the core of Encore AI&#8217;s technology is its unique Interaction Mining engine, a patented method for dissecting how and what behaviors reliably generate the most desired results in conversations with customers in various channels. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">The platform translates these behaviors into AI agents designed to conduct interactions or augment agents in real time. Encore&#8217;s capabilities span voice, chat, interactive voice response and live </span><a href="https://www.lawinsider.com/dictionary/digital-channels" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener external noreferrer" data-wpel-link="external"><span style="font-weight: 400">digital channels</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400"> and meet strict regulations and compliance standards needed to operate safely in industries such as banking and insurance.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">Chief Executive Officer Dr. Dvir Ginzburg said most enterprise AI platforms focus primarily on reducing costs. He explained that Encore AI instead helps organisations unlock the value already contained within years of customer interaction data by teaching AI agents to replicate the actions of their best employees.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">The company says its platform can be deployed within weeks without requiring lengthy implementation projects. One major lending customer reportedly achieved a tenfold return on investment only months after deploying the technology.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">More News: </span><a href="https://ventureburn.com/dwelly-raises-170m-series-b-ai-property-management/" data-wpel-link="internal"><span style="font-weight: 400">Dwelly Raises $170M to Accelerate AI-Led Property Management</span></a></p>
<h2><b>Funding Supports Global Expansion And Product Development</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">Encore AI currently serves more than 40 enterprise customers worldwide, with financial institutions representing the majority of its client base. According to the company, annual recurring revenue has grown more than fivefold since its previous funding round less than 18 months ago.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">The new capital will primarily support expansion of the company&#8217;s United States sales operations while increasing deployments among larger financial organisations. Encore AI also plans to continue enhancing its proprietary AI models and enterprise capabilities.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">Team8 Partner Hadar Siterman Norris said many organisations possess years of valuable customer interaction data but have yet to convert it into measurable business value. She believes Encore AI has created a platform capable of transforming that information into sustained revenue growth while maintaining the compliance architecture required by regulated industries.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">Planven Managing Partner Eran Westman added that successful enterprise AI companies will be defined by the long-term value they create rather than automation alone. He described Encore AI&#8217;s combination of proprietary data analysis and industry expertise as a strong foundation for building a category-leading platform.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">As businesses increasingly seek practical applications for artificial intelligence, the company aims to help organisations improve sales performance, strengthen customer engagement, and scale the expertise of their highest-performing employees through intelligent automation.</span></p>
